# Play test of Frost Hollow (CIPlay frost_hollow, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Frost Hollow
# DEEP 10-25: the south point moved the land's centre (the recipe's save prints the exact offset)
offset 0.34 -6.17
expect step 0
expect title Power for Frost Hollow

# The village between the igloos: the research log on a crate
walk 28 0 to 17 0 h=3.9
zone village
expect step 1
read Research log
expect step 2

# The cables: one by each igloo's door, one in the polar bear's shed
walk 17 0 to 19 -2.5 h=3.9
openat 19.6 -3.4
expect story cable 1
walk 19 -2.5 to 15.8 1.4 h=3.9
openat 14.4 3.4
expect story cable 2
expect step 3
zone shedzone
expect message polar bear rears up
kill Polar bear
expect step 4
walk -1 7 to 0.5 11.8 h=8.2
openat 1.5 13
expect story cable 3
expect step 5

# DEEP 10-25: the sample store on the south point, the assistant's cache under the hatch
zone samplecave
expect step 6
read Lab assistant Tomas Berg's note
expect step 7
use storehatch
expect message The hatch lifts

# The lab: shut, then powered - its doors slide open; the locker inside
walk -19 3 to -19 -2 h=5.5
walk -19 -2 to -19 -7 blocked
walk -20.4 -2 to -20.4 -7 blocked
walk -17.6 -2 to -17.6 -7 blocked
use powerbox
expect message doors slide apart
expect story cable 0
wait 2
walk -17.6 -2 to -17.6 -7 h=5.5
walk -19 -2 to -19 -7 to -12 -8 h=5.5
open Lab locker
expect item Battery_Advanced 1
expect done
